WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Mix topsoil from several places in the bed. Pick out the stones, roots and leaves.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Fill a third with soil. Add water and dish soap. Seal, shake and set down.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
After one minute, sand has settled at the bottom. Mark the top of that layer.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
After two hours, mark the top of the next layer. This finer material is silt.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:43.000
Check after one or two days. Once the water is mostly clear, mark the clay layer. Organic matter floats on top.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Compare the height of each layer with the total height of the settled soil.
